## Y. Final System Understanding
The ECUlytics Platform is a highly decoupled, microservice-based SaaS platform designed to safely absorb battery telemetry and transform it into explainable engineering insights. It enforces a strict **trust boundary** at the edge, ensuring only physically plausible, authenticated data reaches the AI. The core product is the **Thermal Intelligence Pipeline**, which uses a virtual sensor to reconstruct the battery's temperature field and evaluate risks. Because AI can hallucinate and clouds can be hacked, the platform wraps this intelligence in two critical safety nets: a **Blockchain Ledger** to guarantee forensic immutability, and a **RAG Knowledge Assistant** to ground AI alerts in approved, verifiable OEM documentation. The system is strictly **advisory**, stopping at the UI dashboard and never writing control loops back to the vehicle.
